/-!
# Actual sphere antiholomorphic one-forms and their genuine acyclicity

The form sections are actual smooth coefficient functions in the
constructed sphere's two affine charts, with the conjugated derivative
of inversion as their transition.  Their genuine sheaf condition is
proved by actual smooth coefficient gluing.  Real smooth sphere
partitions supply actual fine decompositions, and the proved fine-sheaf
Ext argument gives unconditional positive-degree cohomology vanishing.

The same package records the actual real smooth charts, single-chart
determination of sections, and the real continuous-linear antilinear
covectors represented by these coefficients.  No analytic vanishing or
Dolbeault exactness is assumed here.
-/
